{"id":"e3c2e4c6dd0d4529","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-non-theorem.md","title":"GL Non Theorem","display":"df-gl-non-theorem — GL Non Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-non-theorem","aliases":["89-df-gl-non-theorem"],"display":"df-gl-non-theorem — GL Non Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-theorem]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-non-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-non-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-non-theorem — GL Non Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c2a8f862c318be2c\" href=\"?note=c2a8f862c318be2c\" title=\"89-df-gl-theorem\">89-df-gl-theorem</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c2a8f862c318be2c\" href=\"?note=c2a8f862c318be2c\" title=\"89-df-gl-theorem\">89-df-gl-theorem</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonThm}_{G\\!L}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{NonThm}_{G\\!L}(A)\\)</span> 是下述定义的一元非定理谓词，公式参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，成员集合为同条定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{N\\!T}_{G\\!L}\">\\(\\mathcal{N\\!T}_{G\\!L}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}non\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{N\\!T}_{G\\!L}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\setminus\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L},\n\\qquad\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\quad\n(\\mathrm{NonThm}_{G\\!L}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathcal{N\\!T}_{G\\!L}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}non\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{N\\!T}_{G\\!L}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\setminus\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L},\n\\qquad\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\quad\n(\\mathrm{NonThm}_{G\\!L}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathcal{N\\!T}_{G\\!L}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL非定理在 GL 中没有证明</li>\n<li>GL非定理是 GL 完全性的关键</li>\n<li>GL非定理与 GL 模型相关</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"c2a8f862c318be2c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"c2a8f862c318be2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-gl-theorem]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonThm}_{G\\!L}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{N\\!T}_{G\\!L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}non\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{N\\!T}_{G\\!L}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\setminus\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L},\n\\qquad\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\quad\n(\\mathrm{NonThm}_{G\\!L}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathcal{N\\!T}_{G\\!L}).","display":true}],"bytes":935,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-253","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-non-theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["c2a8f862c318be2c"]}